  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.20 Plan of correction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.20 “Plan of correction” means a list of specific actions to be taken with a deadline for taking each action, to reflect how a licensee will correct a violation of, and come into compliance with, Plc 1500 and RSA 326-E.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.16) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
